t\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.93.1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Halloweenly</b> Tree is a large purple tree that has light rays emitting from the leaves and the log emitting a glow.\n</p><p>It is an event tree which spawns randomly during <b>Saturday</b>s. (starts every midnight, EST) When finding this, It is recommended to use a <b><a href=\"/wiki/UFO\" title=\"UFO\">UFO</a></b> and fly to the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Shrine\" title=\"Heavenly Shrine\">Heavenly Shrine</a></b> at <b><a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_Peaks\" title=\"Snowy Peaks\">Snowy Peaks</a></b>. If a pedestal lights up with a purple light, that means there is a <b>Halloweenly</b> Tree in the direction of the pedestal. It can spawn in unusual places such as on the edges of something, and in unreachable places.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p><b>Halloweenly</b> Tree spawns with a lot of <a href=\"/wiki/Bomb_fruit\" title=\"Bomb fruit\">Bomb fruits</a>, so make sure to get rid of them, otherwise they will explode after cutting the tree and it will probably get flung.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 614px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png/revision/latest?cb=20251011151221\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"614\" height=\"345\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rpob halloweenly spawn time.png\" data-image-key=\"Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/614?cb=20251011151221\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png/revision/latest?cb=20251011151221\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/614?cb=20251011151221\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"614\" height=\"345\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rpob halloweenly spawn time.png\" data-image-key=\"Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/23/Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/614?cb=20251011151221\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rpob_halloweenly_spawn_time.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 698px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/de/Halloweenly.png/revision/latest?cb=20251011090132\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)\" src=\"data:im